iers, user text strings verbatim in their own script, English description, single-line JSON output) unchanged.\n","sampling_mode":"on","sampling_mode.temperature":1.0,"sampling_mode.top_k":20,"sampling_mode.top_p":0.95,"sampling_mode.min_p":0.05,"sampling_mode.repetition_penalty":1.05,"sampling_mode.seed":42}},"499":{"class_type":"easy showAnything","inputs":{"anything":["4013",0]}}}
